{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-11-30 16:15:00', 'title': 'VSG PARTNERS WITH TEXA TO EXPAND ADVANCED DRIVER ASSISTANCE SYSTEM TOOLS AND OFFER NEW AIR CONDITIONING CHARGING FOR AUTOMOTIVE SERVICE', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , NOV. 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROTARY, PART OF VEHICLE SERVICE GROUP\xa0(VSG) AND DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), TODAY ANNOUNCED A PARTNERSHIP WITH TEXA, A GLOBAL LEADER IN THE DESIGN, DEVELOPMENT AND PRODUCTION OF DIAGNOSTIC TOOLS FOR THE VEHICLE REPAIR INDUSTRY, THAT WILL ENABLE ROTARY TO EXPAND ITS AUTOMOTIVE SERVICE OFFERINGS.'}